<title>SINGAPORE: Elec &amp; Eltek 1st-half net up 8.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Elec &amp; Eltek 1st-half net up 8.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million of Singapore dollars unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     25.26 vs   23.33</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			8.00 vs    8.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		  24.52 vs   22.65</p>
<p>    Turnover				151.74 vs  153.69</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.89 vs    0.94</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     42.18 vs   34.10</p>
<p>    Interest expense			1.44 vs    1.04</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	  11.09 vs    6.89</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 29.65 vs   26.17</p>
<p>    Tax					 2.83 vs    1.86</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		     1.56 vs    0.98</p>
<p>Note - Elec &amp; Eltek International Co Ltd makes and distributes printed circuit boards for the computer industry.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
